  description: A moonlit sunken court where Not a witch kneels weeping and ignores
    you. Leave her be and nothing happens; hit her and she wakes for a hard fight
    with a Legendary drop.
  paintFootprint: 1
  footprint: {fileID: 0}
  allowRotation: 1
  width: 9
